<cem:description>
<cem:recommendedUse lang="en">This educational digital resource can be used as a practice activity as a starting point for developing a prompt. The teacher could work further with activities and tasks of this kind in order to help students extending their procedural knowledge.</cem:recommendedUse>
<cem:triggerQuestion lang="en">Do you cook with lots of spices?; Which ones do you use?; Which spice do you like?</cem:triggerQuestion>
<cem:pedagogicalAspect lang="en">The information about Quantifiers: some, any, a little, few, e.g., I'd also like some ginger; Countable and uncontable nouns, e.g., Chili pepper, cinnamon stick, ginger; Why don't you ...?, e.g., Why don’t you try heating them in a frying pan? Is presented within the context of Ask for and give simple advice. The students will be exposed to vocabulary related to: Food and Drink, e.g., Chili pepper, cinnamon stick, ginger.</cem:pedagogicalAspect>
<cem:learningGoal lang="en">The purpose of this learning object is to Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations.</cem:learningGoal>
</cem:description>
</cem:educational>
