<cem:description lang="en">This lesson: "Vanessa in Cooking School: Indian Food" belongs to Elementary (A2.1). It is composed of twelve learning objects, that have the following learning outcomes: relate information about health and healthy habits in communicative situations; accurately use information about directions to places in a limited range of social situations; accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations; identify ways of improving aspects of the use of expressions, structures and vocabulary according to the learning outcomes of level Elementary A; describe common activities at work to a visitor using short sentences. On the other hand, the communicative functions of this lesson are: ask for and give simple instructions; ask for, make, respond to suggestions; ask for or report about things, actions, events, or people; ask and say where a place is.</cem:description>
</cem:resource>
